(Leonard:)I'm trying to sleep.
Good night.

10
00:00:26,064 --> 00:00:27,694
Boy!

11
00:00:29,067 --> 00:00:32,137
(Sheldon:)Taylor was right-- haters gonna
hate, hate, hate, hate, hate.

12
